        <headline>Frost Advisory issued September 24 at 1:00PM EDT until September 25 at 9:00AM EDT by NWS Baltimore MD/Washington DC</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...Temperatures as low as 33 will result in frost formation.

* WHERE...Eastern Garrett County.

* WHEN...From 1 AM to 9 AM EDT Friday.

* IMPACTS...Frost could harm sensitive outdoor vegetation. Sensitive
outdoor plants may be killed if left uncovered.
</description>
        <instruction>Take steps now to protect tender plants from the cold.</instruction>
